      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have slightly more details on the slightly older https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/some-youtube-videos-cannot-be-played .\n\nI wish PYTHONWARNINGS worked because you don't need to rebuild the executable to change environment variables, but it doesn't do anything because of the exe packer being used. VRChat needs to ignore unexpected output on stderr if the expected output is received on stdout.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
