      "value": "@{63691297469f06772579fe6f|full_name}: I created a new ticket with more details. It's a similar issue where yt-dlp emits a warning which VRChat incorrectly interprets as failure, but it's a different warning. https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/1275-some-youtube-videos-not-loading-again",
